# Passive recorder for Virginia (Enhanced Voting), Iowa and South Carolina (Clarity): one request at a time every 60 s,
# dated gzip snapshots under /srv/brunder/extrarec. Separate checkout (/srv/brunder/evdb), not the election repo.
# Exits by itself at --until (2026-11-04 12:00 UTC), so Restart=on-failure does not bring it back after that.
[Unit]
Description=brunder extra-source recorder (VA Enhanced Voting, IA + SC Clarity)
Wants=network-online.target
After=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=simple
User=brunder
Group=brunder
WorkingDirectory=/srv/brunder/evdb
Environment=HOME=/srv/brunder
Environment=PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1
ExecStart=/srv/brunder/.local/bin/uv run --frozen python analysis/extra_recorder.py --out /srv/brunder/extrarec --until 2026-11-04T12:00:00Z
Restart=on-failure
RestartSec=30
Nice=15
CPUQuota=10%
MemoryMax=512M
IOSchedulingClass=idle
